The source is in https://github.com/gmcnaught/synthcores under
cores/synclavier/. This repository holds the built cores (releases/*.rbf),
the MGLs, the tools that make the disk and state images the core loads
(tools/, with the Python simulator they use in sim/) and the documentation.
Its history before the move to synthcores still holds the source up to
Synclavier_20261118.

This repository contains:

