  * The built cores (releases/*.rbf) include the MiSTer framework
    (Template_MiSTer, mister/sys/ in the source), unchanged, under the GNU
    General Public License version 2 (licenses/GPL-2.0.txt). A built core
    is distributed under GPL-2.0.

It does not contain NED disk images, timbre or sound files, ROM contents,
or board photos. docs/sources.md in the source lists every source used,
with URLs, commits and checksums.

